# Keep the Docker build context small + reproducible: no installed modules, build outputs, or
# local caches — the image installs from the lockfile and builds fresh.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/target
**/.spherewiki-data
**/.next
.git
**/*.log
# App-local state / test artifacts that must never enter the image.
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
apps/desktop/src-tauri/target
